            "keyPoints": [
                "Almost every major video model now bills per second of finished video, not per clip.",
                "Cheapest tiers are cents per second: Veo 3.1 Lite $0.05/s, Sora 2 $0.10/s, Kling 3.0 from about $0.084/s.",
